# The cost and the look of the eyes' multisampling (#226, docs/vr/TESTING.md "Eye MSAA"): the eyes at
# the size SteamVR recommends for the Index on the owner's PC, no pacing - the rate line then shows how
# fast the game can draw both eyes - and one shot after the measurement, for the edge comparison.
# Run once per sample count: smoke-test.ps1 -VrSim msaa -- --vr-msaa <n>

rate 0                         # no pacing: xrWaitFrame returns at once, frames per second = what the PC draws
eye-size 2468 2740             # SteamVR's recommended eye size for the Index here (#19)
timeline gameplay

@6000 shot edges               # past the level fade-in at any rate this PC reaches, after the measurement (shots stall their frame, ~100 ms)
